<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures drift with one lot sold.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures drift with one lot sold.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange wheat broke out of last week's tradeless pattern to post a single sale on Monday, with January 1998 falling by A$1.50 to A$165.50.</p>
<p>Settlement prices showed no real trend with prices mainly gaining or losing 50 cents a contract.</p>
<p>One broker said the market remained very quite with the single lot traded probably reflecting a grower securing a price for the new crop.  </p>
